WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 11 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:04.770
Did you see what your bad waxing did?

2
00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.770
It's not the wax, it's your board.

3
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.750
That's my fault — if you're trying to unleash her abilities, you're distracting her, unfortunately.

4
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.750
Upwards.

5
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:19.750
What?

6
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.750
I think you meant to say you lift her up.

7
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.750
You're a professional surfer, and I salute you for that, but I know an island...

8
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.750
And I know how to show you the move.

9
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.750
I might think so. Let's go then.

10
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:49.900
Mario, you're a professional, and you're just an amateur — don't fight.

11
00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:56.530
Are you one of those men who wait for a girl to save them?

12
00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.640
I don't know what's happening there. I'll do better tomorrow.

13
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.640
Don't worry, you were amazing.

14
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.640
But I just fell.

15
00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:12.640
It's not just your surfing — you're charming, and a great man supports you.

16
00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:19.200
I look forward to seeing you tomorrow.

17
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.080
We should celebrate together.

18
00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:29.080
Yes, definitely.

19
00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.080
I'll fix it with a new board.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:37.600
You think Oman is the great man who supports her.

21
00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:40.600
One more day.
